ation"},{"type":"h","text":"Periodontal maintenance"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical model"},{"type":"h","text":"Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk Identification"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral Hygiene"},{"type":"h","text":"Non-Surgical Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Reassessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Maintenance / Referral"}]},{"heading":"Oral Surgery","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop supervised competence in appropriate basic procedures."},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dental extraction principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Local anesthesia"},{"type":"h","text":"Sterility"},{"type":"h","text":"Surgical instruments"},{"type":"h","text":"Wound management"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-operative instructions"},{"type":"h","text":"Complication recognition"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to identify cases requiring referral to oral and maxillofacial specialists."}]},{"heading":"Prosthodontics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Complete dentures"},{"type":"h","text":"Removable partial dentures"},{"type":"h","text":"Fixed prosthodontic concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Crowns"},{"type":"h","text":"Bridges"},{"type":"h","text":"Impressions"},{"type":"h","text":"Occlusion"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient selection"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern practice also increasingly involves:"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital impressions"},{"type":"h","text":"CAD/CAM"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital smile design"},{"type":"h","text":"3D printing"}]},{"heading":"Pediatric Dentistry","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Child behavior management"},{"type":"h","text":"Early childhood caries"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive dentistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Fluoride"},{"type":"h","text":"Sealants"},{"type":"h","text":"Primary dentition"},{"type":"h","text":"Developing dentition"},{"type":"h","text":"Oral-health education"},{"type":"p","text":"Communication should be age-appropriat